### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@camara = camara_insurgentes_reforma
@desde = 2026-04-07T00:00:00Z
@hasta = 2026-04-07T23:59:59Z
@origenLat = 19.4326
@origenLng = -99.1332
@destinoLat = 19.4500
@destinoLng = -99.1500

### Health quick check (camaras)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/camaras
Accept: application/json

### Registrar deteccion - auto
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vehiculos/deteccion
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "camara": "{{camara}}",
  "timestamp": "2026-04-07T10:23:45Z",
  "tipo": "auto",
  "color": "#FF0000",
  "segundos_en_pantalla": 4.2
}

### Registrar deteccion - moto
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vehiculos/deteccion
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "camara": "{{camara}}",
  "timestamp": "2026-04-07T10:24:30Z",
  "tipo": "moto",
  "color": "#00FFFF",
  "segundos_en_pantalla": 3.0
}

### Consultar historial por camara y rango
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/historial?camara={{camara}}&desde={{desde}}&hasta={{hasta}}
Accept: application/json

### Calcular ruta - PEATON
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ruta
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origen": {"lat": {{origenLat}}, "lng": {{origenLng}}},
  "destino": {"lat": {{destinoLat}}, "lng": {{destinoLng}}},
  "perfil": "PEATON"
}

### Calcular ruta - CONDUCTOR
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ruta
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origen": {"lat": {{origenLat}}, "lng": {{origenLng}}},
  "destino": {"lat": {{destinoLat}}, "lng": {{destinoLng}}},
  "perfil": "CONDUCTOR"
}

### Calcular ruta - COMBINADA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ruta
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origen": {"lat": {{origenLat}}, "lng": {{origenLng}}},
  "destino": {"lat": {{destinoLat}}, "lng": {{destinoLng}}},
  "perfil": "COMBINADA"
}
